WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.446
You don't need a huge custom AI project to
start.

2
00:00:03.596 --> 00:00:06.880
But a generic assistant won't know how
your industry works.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.999
So you start from a brain made for your
industry.

4
00:00:11.149 --> 00:00:12.446
The agents are ready.

5
00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:14.071
We set them up on your data.

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.579
First, one call to pick your package and
check the fit.

7
00:00:19.729 --> 00:00:21.894
If it's not right for you, we'll say so.

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.483
Then we spend a few days adapting it.

9
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:30.335
Your services, your tone, and when to hand
things to a person.

10
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.901
Next comes a pilot on real cases.

11
00:00:35.051 --> 00:00:37.172
Say a buyer writes late on a Saturday.

12
00:00:37.322 --> 00:00:41.250
The agent answers, asks two questions, and
holds a Monday showing.

13
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.481
Your team sees every conversation.

14
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.007
Once it works, we host it and keep it
running.

15
00:00:47.157 --> 00:00:49.650
Updates and support come with your
subscription.

16
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.275
Your team keeps the final say.

17
00:00:54.425 --> 00:00:57.182
And if you outgrow it, it becomes a custom
brain.

18
00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.363
Want in?

19
00:00:59.513 --> 00:01:02.666
Request early access at
sandboxinnovate.com.

